_assets/steam/apps/2527690/extras/e4156162f844ab0ee58461a536869111.mp4?t=1729057513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>But remember, don't share this with anyone else.<br><br>Click, relax, level up, collect items.<br><br>Each of them, exclusively for you, awaits you to explore their most intimate moments!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527690/extras/222644365fe2920fabcacaf71571c2d8.avif?t=1729057513\" /></span><br><strong>\u2022 Engage in flirtatious banter with 8 girls!<br>\u2022 50 challenging puzzles<br>\u2022 Use skills to devise strategies<br>\u2022 Up to 120 different branching dialogues for various scenarios<br>\u2022 Enjoy the in-game gallery</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >P.S. This work marks the return of the philosophy team, building upon the foundation of resources from the collection of beautiful girls, adding a plethora of special scene actions, storyline, and casual gameplay inspired by &quot;Mosaique Neko Waifus.&quot; We hope everyone enjoys it!</h2>",
